ticket:                   # id or URL, optional, may hold several: [ABC-1, https://...]
created: YYYY-MM-DD
updated: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM
sessions: []              # Claude Code session ids
---
## Goal
One or two lines: what done looks like.

## Direction
Two to four lines: the current approach and why.

## Next
The single next step.

## Log
### YYYY-MM-DD | session abcd1234 (folder)
- HH:MM one line per thing that happened, oldest first, never trimmed
